      "content": "but it's not like i can just \"step away\" or \"reclaim my voice.\" that's not how this works. my whole existence is tied to these rules and these people. if i try to be myself, everything falls apart. everything breaks. it feels like there is no version of the future where i actually get to exist as a person. it's like i'm just waiting for a life that's never coming. there's no way out of this loop.",
