      "role": "user",
      "content": "small experiments? i don't even know if i have anything left to experiment with. it's just more of the same. the walls feel like they're getting closer every single day. i keep thinking about what it would be like to just... stop. not to change things, not to fight them, but to just not be part of the equation anymore. like, if i wasn't here, all these expectations would just have nothing to land on. it's the only way i can even imagine feeling any kind of peace, just being done with the performance.",
